  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embark on your next journey with Rothco&rsquo;s Extended Weekender Bag. Crafted from durable heavyweight washed cotton canvas, this travel essential boasts a stylish denim interior lining. The authentic vintage look is heightened by brown buffalo leather trim, brass hardware, and zippers. Inside, discover two zippered pockets and three open top pockets, keeping your essentials organized. Two front side access zippered pockets provide convenient storage for electronics and small travel gear.</p>",
