  "description": "<p>Embark on your next journey with Rothco&rsquo;s Extended Weekender Bag. Crafted from durable heavyweight washed cotton canvas, this travel essential boasts a stylish denim interior lining. The authentic vintage look is heightened by brown buffalo leather trim, brass hardware, and zippers. Inside, discover two zippered pockets and three open top pockets, keeping your essentials organized. Two front side access zippered pockets provide convenient storage for electronics and small travel gear, while a rear zippered pocket secures travel documents and important items. Designed for practicality, the weekender features a hard bottom with four brass pegs, ensuring it stands upright during packing and unpacking. The sturdy top carry leather handles and adjustable/removable shoulder strap offer comfortable carry options on the go. Measuring 23 inch x 11 inch x 14 inch, this oversized travel bag provides ample storage for an extended stay. Rothco&rsquo;s Extended Weekender Bag combines functionality, durability, and vintage style to elevate your travel experience</p>",
